    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secrets\" title=\"Force Secrets\">Force Secrets</a></i> </p><p>Whenever you activate a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to add one use of any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> known by any ally within 12 squares of you (whether you know that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> or not) to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a>. Once used, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> cannot be regained by any means, and if the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> is not used by the end of your next turn, it is lost. You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Point\">Destiny Point</a> to have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> lost at the end of the encounter instead of the end of your next turn. </p><p>Additionally, you can enhance any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Holocron\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Holocron\">Holocron</a> you possess, adding your knowledge to it's memory. You can create a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Holocron_Gatekeeper\" title=\"Holocron Gatekeeper\">Holocron Gatekeeper</a> in your own image in that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Holocron\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Holocron\">Holocron</a>. </p>",
